            {
                "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                "word": "PMS",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "85e0c0a4-f3dc-499c-9886-82d85c0ef9a4",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "PMSs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0eab5e25-8f93-38fd-b39f-1e0a6f5eb432",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of premenstrual syndrome or premenstrual stress."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8251df72-037a-47bf-a486-8389276cd906",
                                "sense_id": "0eab5e25-8f93-38fd-b39f-1e0a6f5eb432",
                                "text": "Premenstrual syndrome (PMS) takes a lot of bashing in the media. It is true that many women become more aggressive during this period, though they are rarely out of control...Therefore, any PMS symptoms that are perceived as unstable are due to the fact that women act more like men during this phase than at any other time in their cycles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3df71d1d-424a-4452-9a6f-d1329ac1d9d3",
                                "sense_id": "0eab5e25-8f93-38fd-b39f-1e0a6f5eb432",
                                "text": "By recognising PMS as a clinical entity women are allowed to Indulge In socially disapproved behaviours, and thus have a safety valve for their resentment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b9c96d8-9bc1-49e6-bd0e-e51015da0c5e",
                                "sense_id": "0eab5e25-8f93-38fd-b39f-1e0a6f5eb432",
                                "text": "Holden, Banky, this pile of PMS is Alyssa Jones."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76d8e3b0-09fd-4bd0-a682-15b983f88b23",
                                "sense_id": "0eab5e25-8f93-38fd-b39f-1e0a6f5eb432",
                                "text": "By internalizing ideational valuations of PMS, men and women reinforce the appearance of a psychosomatic constitution of PMS."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b10e464-d133-45fc-9c9a-eadf10b0ea79",
                                "sense_id": "0eab5e25-8f93-38fd-b39f-1e0a6f5eb432",
                                "text": "This is called premenstrual syndrome, or PMS. It is not well defined, and more than 100 different symptoms have been attributed to PMS"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3dc75973-8b1a-38df-8d3c-90d7cf874b52",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of package management system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0aac438b-e3e8-3c4b-bd98-e9f0d18b3a4d",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of performance measurement system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d628ed6d-6fb6-4a8e-8a46-64c0c245336c",
                                "sense_id": "0aac438b-e3e8-3c4b-bd98-e9f0d18b3a4d",
                                "text": "The federal Performance Measurement System (PMS) and how It relates to the field of corrections."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8808fb41-e501-499e-82ce-985770bc2751",
                                "sense_id": "0aac438b-e3e8-3c4b-bd98-e9f0d18b3a4d",
                                "text": "Some authors, (see Simons, 1999) suggest that a PMS [performance measurement system] should include an external monitor component."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5f0317f6-74bf-37c1-9377-83e608b3ea9b",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of performance management system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "440afcf2-5196-4af6-981a-f51d79e51e9b",
                                "sense_id": "5f0317f6-74bf-37c1-9377-83e608b3ea9b",
                                "text": "PMS: Performance-management system"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d052e5ee-854b-308c-a9bf-517c84d6f6f4",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of performance monitoring system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "427e7d61-234d-4304-b0cf-7be50153ced0",
                                "sense_id": "d052e5ee-854b-308c-a9bf-517c84d6f6f4",
                                "text": "A performance monitoring system (PMS) exists with formal elements for monitoring poverty reduction in relation to the PARPA."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06b36047-f3ed-35c7-8968-8e1beb2ad3bf",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of planned maintenance system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "96c8446b-ac6f-4700-b107-32805bed7d81",
                                "sense_id": "06b36047-f3ed-35c7-8968-8e1beb2ad3bf",
                                "text": "Planned maintenance system for surface missile ships (PMS/SMS) has been instituted to increase system readiness through a major reduction in system downtime."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a29a91d8-b5dd-4e28-a0f7-879013d9b9ec",
                                "sense_id": "06b36047-f3ed-35c7-8968-8e1beb2ad3bf",
                                "text": "Have the hazardous materials associated with the system, particularly for the Planned Maintenance System (PMS), been identified?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28e91dcc-89d7-4cf1-b30b-6bed519cea1a",
                                "sense_id": "06b36047-f3ed-35c7-8968-8e1beb2ad3bf",
                                "text": "Oil shall be changed out on compressors in strict accordance with the PMS requirements applicable to that compressor."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13b89c4b-ce24-314b-91dd-fb851eb50cd4",
                        "entry_id": "c6df0e1f-ab89-3cf3-b026-645fd928f27b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of project management system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55f7bac2-ef30-4106-8ddc-bb97b08f66ec",
                                "sense_id": "13b89c4b-ce24-314b-91dd-fb851eb50cd4",
                                "text": "A more comprehensive system now being marketed by IBM, PMS (Project Management System), includes resource allocation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88ea1172-2a99-48a9-b22c-1e6eb6598532",
                                "sense_id": "13b89c4b-ce24-314b-91dd-fb851eb50cd4",
                                "text": "Mr. Tiernan. ...You have [a chart of] performance based on average design and construction performance before PMS. What is PMS? Mr. Starobin. Project Management System."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bec04310-60c5-416a-a47d-9a8726f615a5",
                                "sense_id": "13b89c4b-ce24-314b-91dd-fb851eb50cd4",
                                "text": "We see many changes needed, and IS/IT solutions include executive information system (ElS), project management system (PMS), research library system (RLS), customer relationship management (CRM), enterprise resources planning (ERP), electronic market places (EMS), and knowledge management system (KMS)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
